    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c6/Vesper_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241118131224\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Vesper Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c6/Vesper_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241118131224\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"968\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Vesper Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Vesper_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eCommander of Chaos\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA half-demon, but her demon blood is much thicker than most. She has the power to control both people and beasts, and dreams of creating an \"army of chaos\". Two of her three pairs of wings are actually only for show. She believes that the more wings one has, the cooler they are.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/Img_1_1670416703137.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20221211122735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Img 1 1670416703137\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/Img_1_1670416703137.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20221211122735\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"665\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Img 1 1670416703137.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Img_1_1670416703137.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 2026081818